    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University hosted its Health-Tech Summit this week with caretaker Prime Minister Anwaar-ul-Haq Kakar and other top government officials in attendance. Held in collaboration with AIM consulting, the two-day event brought together health care and technology leaders from across Pakistan and around the world to explore how technology can transform health care, including for low-income populations.",
